WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.802
In this video, you will vote for your favorite homes in a neighborhood contest, and see how voting works, so you know your vote counts.

00:00:07.802 --> 00:00:08.891
We start on the map.

00:00:09.799 --> 00:00:13.861
To begin, open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:13.861 --> 00:00:15.986
That is the only address you need.

00:00:18.412 --> 00:00:20.819
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:20.819 --> 00:00:24.563
The first time you visit, it asks to use your location.

00:00:24.563 --> 00:00:25.900
Tap Use my location.

00:00:27.706 --> 00:00:32.143
That is how the map shows how far things are, and gives you directions.

00:00:32.143 --> 00:00:35.348
Your browser asks permission as well, so tap Allow.

00:00:35.348 --> 00:00:39.909
Your location is used only on your device, and you can say no at any time.

00:00:43.486 --> 00:00:46.175
Now look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:46.175 --> 00:00:47.371
See the three dots?

00:00:47.371 --> 00:00:51.673
That is the menu, and it is the doorway to everything else on the site.

00:00:51.673 --> 00:00:52.211
Tap them.

00:00:54.476 --> 00:00:56.114
In the menu, tap Contests.

00:00:56.114 --> 00:01:01.452
That is where every neighborhood contest lives: the ones you can vote in, enter, or run.

00:01:03.253 --> 00:01:06.220
Under Live now, find the contest, and tap Vote.

00:01:06.220 --> 00:01:09.063
The first time, the site asks you to sign in.

00:01:09.063 --> 00:01:12.896
That keeps it fair, with one vote per person in each category.

00:01:14.903 --> 00:01:17.936
Want to see the homes in person before you decide?

00:01:17.936 --> 00:01:19.185
Tap Visit the homes.

00:01:19.185 --> 00:01:24.716
It splits the homes into routes of nine stops or fewer, and sends each one to your maps app.

00:01:24.716 --> 00:01:29.772
Each route starts where the last one ended, and you can tick off each home as you go.

00:01:30.679 --> 00:01:31.624
Now the ballot.

00:01:31.624 --> 00:01:35.642
Every home is in every category, and you pick one favorite in each.

00:01:35.642 --> 00:01:38.538
Start with the first category, Best Traditional.

00:01:38.538 --> 00:01:41.729
Look through the homes, and tap Vote on your favorite.

00:01:43.662 --> 00:01:45.956
The next category opens by itself.

00:01:45.956 --> 00:01:50.808
In Most Creative, tap Vote on the display you think is the most inventive.

00:01:52.737 --> 00:01:54.312
And last, Best Animated.

00:01:54.312 --> 00:01:55.446
Tap your favorite.

00:01:57.938 --> 00:01:59.054
Thanks for voting!

00:01:59.054 --> 00:02:03.400
Your votes are saved, and you can change any of them until voting closes.

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:05.456
You cannot vote for your own home.

00:02:05.456 --> 00:02:11.271
And tap Share this contest, to send it to a neighbor, because more votes make the contest more fun.

00:02:13.028 --> 00:02:14.841
Next up: Judge a contest.
